OL,4,CMushroom murderer Erin Patterson       
OL,5,Claunches last-ditch High Court appeal  
OL,6,GAustralia's mushroom killer Erin       
OL,7,GPatterson has launched a final legal   
OL,8,Gbid to overturn her murder convictions 
OL,9,Gand avoid dying in jail.               
OL,11,FPatterson, 52, was last year found     
OL,12,Fguilty of murdering three relatives    
OL,13,Fand attempting to kill another when    
OL,14,Fshe served them a toxic mushroom-laced 
OL,15,Fmeal in 2023.                          
